		<item>
			<title>Madonna to go to Los Angeles for the Yom Kippur?</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/132-madonna-to-go-to-los-angeles-for-the-yom-kippur?.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/132-madonna-to-go-to-los-angeles-for-the-yom-kippur?.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>It is rumoured that <strong>Madonna</strong> is thinking of going to <strong>Los Angeles</strong> this weekend, October 7-8, for the <strong>Yom Kippur</strong>, the highest and most powerful day of the year for <strong>Kabbalists</strong>. Rumours are not confirmed.</p>
<p><strong>Rav</strong> and <strong>Karen Bergen</strong> will be there celebrating this important day for <strong>Kabbalah</strong>.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Everyday Life</category>
			<pubDate>Mon, 03 Oct 2011 20:27:41 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Madonna denies rumors that she wants to buy one of the Palladian Villas of the Veneto in the surround area of Vicenza</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/41-madonna-denies-rumors-that-she-wants-to-buy-one-of-the-palladian-villas-of-the-veneto-in-the-surround-area-of-vicenza.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/41-madonna-denies-rumors-that-she-wants-to-buy-one-of-the-palladian-villas-of-the-veneto-in-the-surround-area-of-vicenza.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p>When <strong>Madonna</strong> was about to arrive in <strong>Venice</strong> to premiere her movie <strong>W.E</strong>. at the Film Festival 2011, Italian press started to report that the diva wanted to buy one of the <strong>Palladian Villas of the Veneto</strong> on the surrounding of <strong>Vicenza</strong>, Italy. These villas, designed by Italian architect Andrea Palladio, are inscribed on UNESCO World Heritage List since 1994.</p>
<p>But, talking with <strong>WWD</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> said that these rumours are "not true."</p>
<p>"Every time I go somewhere, they say that, but enough houses,” she added.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>This is not the first time <strong>Madonna</strong> is reportedly looking for a villa in <strong>Italy</strong>.</p>
<p>When <strong>Madonna</strong> was last months pregnant of <strong>Rocco</strong>, she spent a few weeks in <strong>Italy</strong>. First she went to <strong>Pantelleria Island</strong>, South of Italy, as a guest of Italian photographer <strong>Fabrizio Ferri</strong>, who took some intimate pictures of the pregnant star. Then she moved in <strong>Tuscany</strong> at <strong>Sting</strong> country-house. Finally, in all secrecy, she rented a car and drove to <strong>Umbria</strong>, Central Italy. She went to the <strong>Massa Martana</strong> country-side. Paparazzi got the scoop when she was already there. Reportedly she booked the country-side of Italian celebrity <strong>Marina Ripa di Meana</strong>, who was one of the guest stars on the <strong>W.E.</strong> red carpet in Venice. According to <strong>Marina Ripa di Meana</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> booked her house under an alias, and, when she was staying there, she expressed the wish to buy it, since she was looking for a villa in <strong>Umbria</strong> or <strong>Tuscany</strong>. But <strong>Marina</strong> requested <strong>Madonna</strong> to do a free concert in <strong>Umbria</strong>, to promote her <strong>battle against fur coats</strong>, as a clause. At the end, as known, there was any concert in <strong>Umbria</strong> neither <strong>Madonna</strong> bought <strong>Marina Ripa di Meana</strong> country-house in <strong>Massa Martana</strong> surrounding.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Everyday Life</category>
			<pubDate>Mon, 05 Sep 2011 23:23:33 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Madonna is in New York City</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/40-madonna-is-in-new-york-city.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/40-madonna-is-in-new-york-city.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Madonna</strong>'s stay in <strong>London</strong> lasted just the time to take a connecting flight from <strong>London</strong>'s <strong>Heathrow Airport</strong> to <strong>JFK Airport</strong> in <strong>New York City</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>Her Madgesty</strong> was with her children <strong>Lourdes</strong>, <strong>Rocco</strong>, <strong>David</strong>, and <strong>Mercy</strong>.</p>
<p>In the <a href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/29-madonna-reveals-the-release-dates-for-her-new-single-and-her-upcoming-album.html" target="_self" title="Interview with Swedish SVT Television">now-famous interview</a> with <strong>Swedish SVT Television</strong>, where <strong>Madonna</strong> revealed the release dates for her new single and upcoming album, she also confessed that "when I go back to New York, till the end of the year I'll be in the recording studio."</p>
<p>But <strong>Madonna</strong> has to take a break soon for the premiere of <strong>W.E.</strong> at the <strong>Toronto International Film Festival 2011</strong>, where her red carpet is planned for <strong>September 12</strong>.</p>
<p>Another already planned break is on <strong>November 12</strong> for the <strong>Smirnoff Nightlife Exchange Project</strong>, a cool social media marketing strategy to discover a dancer for <strong>Madonna's new tour</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><img src="http://drownedmadonna.com/img/2011/madonna-we-pendant.jpg" border="0" alt="Madonna wearing a W.E. pendant" width="790" height="395" style="border: 0;" /></p>
<p> </p>
<p>Travelling from <strong>Venice</strong> to <strong>London</strong> and finally to <strong>New York</strong>, <strong>Madonna</strong> was spotted wearing a stylish <strong>W.E. pendant</strong> especially designed for her.</p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Everyday Life</category>
			<pubDate>Mon, 05 Sep 2011 17:26:40 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
		<item>
			<title>Madonna left Venice today</title>
			<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/36-madonna-left-venice-today.html</link>
			<guid>http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/36-madonna-left-venice-today.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Madonna</strong> left <strong>Venice</strong> today, after presenting the very first <strong>Gucci Award for Women in Cinema</strong> at <strong>Granai delle Zitelle</strong> in <strong>Venice</strong>'s <strong>Giudecca</strong> isle.</p>
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> went back in <strong>London</strong> with her private plane.</p>
<p>Soon we will see her at the <strong>Toronto Film Festival</strong> for <strong>W.E.</strong></p></div>]]></description>
			<category>Everyday Life</category>
			<pubDate>Sun, 04 Sep 2011 10:39:55 +0000</pubDate>
		</item>
	</channel>
